# Finance volatility trainer (B113 Phase 5) — the top-level deps train_volatility.py actually imports; pip
# resolves a consistent transitive set at build. Deliberately NOT genre-trainer's full 130-line freeze, which
# had drifted into an unbuildable state (pinned cryptography==50.0.0 against mlflow's cryptography<50), so a
# fresh rebuild failed ResolutionImpossible. A lean top-level list is reproducible enough for an on-demand lab
# trainer and can't rot the same way. `ray[default]` carries ray.tune + the dashboard for `--task … --tune`.
mlflow
scikit-learn
pandas
numpy
minio
pyarrow
boto3
ray[default]
